The battle with Yao Changdong played out a bit differently in the novel. It emphasized a lot more on karma than in the donghua. I think you might want to read it.

“My family believes in the glory of our ancestor. All other domains will break under the glory of our ancestor!”
“That’s glory of the past. What of it now? All things are linked to karma. The Celestials' glory is the karmic cause!”
